# Server Actions and Prisma

Use `.agents/engineering-standards.md` as the canonical reference.

- Validate mutation payloads with Zod.
- Derive `userId` from `auth.api.getSession()` or shared helpers on the server.
- Filter every user-owned read/write by session `userId`.
- Check ownership before connecting related records.
- Return structured action results with `success`, `data`, `error` and optional `fieldErrors`.
- Revalidate affected platform routes after successful mutations.
- Use Prisma migrations for schema changes; avoid durable reliance on `db:push`.
- Keep destructive seed behavior clearly local/dev.
